<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned all five auctions whereby it sought to drain 4.798 billion pesos from the secondary market on Tuesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>	680 million  22 days   21.25 pct</p>
<p>	680 million  17 days   21.00 pct</p>
<p>	680 million  10 days   20.73 pct</p>
<p>	2.500 bln   2 days   20.71 pct</p>
<p>	258 million   1 day    20.17 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
